MY_NAME="Text2SIP"
helplink="http://www.loxwiki.eu/display/LOXBERRY/Text2SIP"
PLUGIN_DESCRIPTION="This plugin calls a defined phone number and reads out a text.<br/>It is possible to specify an http:// address to which DTMF codes entered by the called participant are sent.<br/>This allows the LoxBerry, for example, to signal and open the doorbell or to acknowledge and confirm alarms."
